{"id":192,"title":"小测验","summary":"现在是测验时间! 通过解决这些关于递归的问题来测试对知识的掌握。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Quiz","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"e7d939b20b3b11eca68c3af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","title_html":"","render_mode":"continuous","questions":[{"question_id":101,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"递归方法总是比迭代方法的空间消耗要少?","question_text_html":"<p>递归方法总是比迭代方法的空间消耗要少?</p>\n","question_options":[{"text":"正确","text_html":"<p>正确</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"错误","text_html":"<p>错误</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true}]},{"question_id":102,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"请为下面的递归函数填空，该函数计算基数`base`的`exp`次方，如果`pow(2,2)=4`。\n\n```python\ndef pow(base,exp):\n    if exp == 0: \n        return 1\n    else:\n        return ___________\n```\n","question_text_html":"<p>请为下面的递归函数填空，该函数计算基数<code>base</code>的<code>exp</code>次方，如果<code>pow(2,2)=4</code>。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">def pow(base,exp):\n    if exp == 0: \n        return 1\n    else:\n        return ___________\n</code></pre>\n","question_options":[{"text":"```python\nbase * exp\n```\n","text_html":"<pre><code class=\"language-python\">base * exp\n</code></pre>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"```python\nbase * (exp -1)* pow(base,exp)\n```\n","text_html":"<pre><code class=\"language-python\">base * (exp -1)* pow(base,exp)\n</code></pre>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"```python\nbase * pow(base, exp - 1)\n```\n","text_html":"<pre><code class=\"language-python\">base * pow(base, exp - 1)\n</code></pre>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true},{"text":"```python\nexp * pow(base, exp - 1)\n```\n","text_html":"<pre><code class=\"language-python\">exp * pow(base, exp - 1)\n</code></pre>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false}]},{"question_id":103,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"以下